### Create department
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/departments
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Engineering"}

### Create student
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/students
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Aarav","email":"aarav@upes.ac.in","branch":"CSE","department_id":1,"enrollment_date":"2024-08-01"}

### Create course
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/courses
Content-Type: application/json

{"id":"CS101","title":"Backend Development","credits":4,"department_id":1}

### Filter + paginate students
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/students?branch=CSE&department_id=1&search=aarav&page=1&limit=5

### Enroll student
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/students/1/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{"course_id":"CS101","semester":"Fall 2026"}
